Installed by `sov connect codex` on {{DATE}}.

Write wire: `connectors/harness/codex/mirror.sh` every {{INTERVAL}}s via {{SCHEDULER}}
(`{{RUNNER}}`, lane id `{{LABEL}}`), mirroring `~/.codex/memories/` (working tree, never `.git`, never
session transcripts). `MANIFEST.md` is the heartbeat.

Read wire: `connectors/harness/codex/session-start.py`, a SessionStart hook in
`~/.codex/hooks.json`. It maps the working directory to a workstream, runs
`brain-load`, and injects the pack as context. It never writes the pack into this
lane or into Codex's memory files. `brain-load-usage.md` here is its receipt.
